**GraphQL** exposes schema via `__schema` introspection:
```graphql
{
  __schema {
    types { name fields { name } }
  }
}
```
Attackers abuse **nested queries** (e.g., `query { user(id: 1) { posts { title } } }`) to bypass rate limits. **CVE-2022-38834** (Apollo Server) allowed **DoS** via malformed `batchedQueries`.

**Tools:** **GraphQL Voyager**, **InQL Scanner**

